{"nodes": [{"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_md", "label": "2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "page", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L1", "display_label": "Note:2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design", "text": ""}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_design_incremental_updates_entity_deduplication", "label": "Design: Incremental Updates + Entity Deduplication", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L1", "display_label": "Heading:Design: Incremental Updates + Entity Deduplication", "heading_level": 1, "text": "# Design: Incremental Updates + Entity Deduplication\n\n**Date:** 2026-05-04\n**Issues:** #698 (incremental updates), entity deduplication (no issue, proactive)\n**Branch:** v7\n\n---"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_problem", "label": "Problem", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L9", "display_label": "Heading:Problem", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## Problem\n\n1. `graphify extract` rebuilds the full graph from scratch every run \u2014 re-sends all files to the LLM regardless of what changed. For a 1000-file Markdown corpus updated daily this is expensive.\n\n2. LLM extraction is chunk-by-chunk \u2014 the same real-world concept can get different labels across chunks (`AuthManager`, `AuthenticationManager`, `auth_mgr`). No semantic dedup exists beyond exact string normalization.\n\n---"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_pipeline_every_graphify_extract_run", "label": "Pipeline (every `graphify extract` run)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L17", "display_label": "Heading:Pipeline (every `graphify extract` run)", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## Pipeline (every `graphify extract` run)\n\n```\ndetect (full or incremental, auto-detected)\n    \u2193\nAST extract (code files, AST cache-aware)\n    \u2193\nSemantic LLM extract (doc/paper/image files, semantic cache-aware)\n    \u2193\nbuild_merge (merge into existing graph, prune deleted nodes)\n    \u2193\ndeduplicate_entities (normalize \u2192 entropy gate \u2192 MinHash/LSH \u2192 Jaro-Winkler \u2192 community boost \u2192 optional LLM)\n    \u2193\ncluster (full graph, always re-run)\n    \u2193\nscore_all + god_nodes + surprising_connections\n    \u2193\nwrite graph.json + .graphify_analysis.json + manifest.json\n```\n\n---"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_feature_1_incremental_updates", "label": "Feature 1: Incremental Updates", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L39", "display_label": "Heading:Feature 1: Incremental Updates", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## Feature 1: Incremental Updates"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_auto_detection", "label": "Auto-detection", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L41", "display_label": "Heading:Auto-detection", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Auto-detection\nIf `graphify-out/manifest.json` + `graphify-out/graph.json` both exist \u2192 incremental mode. No flag needed. First run is always full."}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_incremental_mode_changes", "label": "Incremental mode changes", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L44", "display_label": "Heading:Incremental mode changes", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Incremental mode changes\n- `detect_incremental(target)` instead of `detect(target)` \u2014 returns `new_files`, `unchanged_files`, `deleted_files`\n- Only `new_files` go through AST + LLM extraction\n- `build_merge(new_chunks, prune_sources=deleted_files)` instead of `build_from_json` \u2014 merges into existing graph, prunes nodes from deleted files\n- `manifest.json` written only on successful completion (crash mid-run does not corrupt next run's diff)"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_semantic_cache_both_full_and_incremental_mode", "label": "Semantic cache (both full and incremental mode)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L50", "display_label": "Heading:Semantic cache (both full and incremental mode)", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Semantic cache (both full and incremental mode)\n- Before LLM call: `check_semantic_cache(files)` splits into `(cached_results, uncached_files)`\n- Only `uncached_files` sent to `extract_corpus_parallel`\n- After LLM call: `save_semantic_cache(fresh_results)` \u2014 keyed by content hash\n- On file rename: `source_file` updated to new path in cached result (same pattern as existing AST cache)"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_output_summary", "label": "Output summary", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L56", "display_label": "Heading:Output summary", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Output summary\n```\n[graphify extract] incremental: 20 changed, 980 cached, 2 deleted\n[graphify extract] graph: 4,821 nodes, 12,304 edges, 43 communities\n[graphify extract] tokens: 18,432 in / 6,201 out, est. cost: $0.08\n```"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_files_changed", "label": "Files changed", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L63", "display_label": "Heading:Files changed", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Files changed\n- `graphify/__main__.py` \u2014 `elif cmd == \"extract\":` block only (~5 targeted changes)\n\n---"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_feature_2_entity_deduplication", "label": "Feature 2: Entity Deduplication", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L68", "display_label": "Heading:Feature 2: Entity Deduplication", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## Feature 2: Entity Deduplication"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_new_module_graphify_dedup_py", "label": "New module: `graphify/dedup.py`", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L70", "display_label": "Heading:New module: `graphify/dedup.py`", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### New module: `graphify/dedup.py`\nSingle responsibility. Called from `build.py` after graph construction. Returns deduplicated `(nodes, edges)`."}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_pipeline", "label": "Pipeline", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L73", "display_label": "Heading:Pipeline", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Pipeline\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 Exact normalization**\nWire up the dormant `deduplicate_by_label` in `build.py`. Catches case/punctuation variants across files. Free win, already written.\n\n**Step 2 \u2014 Entropy gate**\nSkip fuzzy matching on labels with < 2.5 bits/char entropy. Short ambiguous names (`\"AI\"`, `\"DB\"`, `\"x\"`) are too risky to auto-merge. Only high-entropy labels proceed to steps 3-4.\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 MinHash + LSH blocking** (`datasketch`)\n3-gram shingles, 128 permutations, threshold 0.7. Generates candidate pairs in O(n) instead of O(n\u00b2). Sub-second at 10k nodes.\n\n**Step 4 \u2014 Jaro-Winkler verification** (`rapidfuzz`)\nEach candidate pair verified at \u2265 0.92. Catches typos, plurals, spacing variants. Pairs below threshold discarded.\n\n**Step 5 \u2014 Same-community boost**\nPairs where both nodes share a Leiden community ID get +0.05 score bonus. Graphify-specific advantage \u2014 community structure is a strong signal that GraphRAG/LightRAG don't exploit.\n\n**Step 6 \u2014 Union-find merge**\nConfirmed pairs fed into union-find \u2192 connected components \u2192 each component merged into one node. Edges rewired to survivor. Self-loops dropped. Prefer shorter non-chunk-suffixed IDs as survivor.\n\n**Step 7 \u2014 Optional LLM tiebreaker** (`--dedup-llm` flag)\nAmbiguous pairs (score 0.75\u20130.85) batched in groups of 30, one LLM call per batch. ~$0.01 total for 10k nodes. Off by default."}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_integration_point", "label": "Integration point", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L96", "display_label": "Heading:Integration point", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Integration point\nDedup runs after `build_merge` / `build_from_json`, before `cluster`. Order matters: cleaner graph \u2192 better community detection.\n\n```python\n# in build.py\nG = build_merge(...)          # or build_from_json\nG = deduplicate_entities(G)   # new step\ncommunities = cluster(G)      # unchanged\n```"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_new_dependencies", "label": "New dependencies", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L106", "display_label": "Heading:New dependencies", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### New dependencies\n- `datasketch` \u2014 always required (added to `[project.dependencies]`)\n- `rapidfuzz` \u2014 always required (added to `[project.dependencies]`)\n- No `sentence-transformers` / PyTorch dependency"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_files_changed_111", "label": "Files changed", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L111", "display_label": "Heading:Files changed", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Files changed\n- `graphify/dedup.py` \u2014 new module, full pipeline\n- `graphify/build.py` \u2014 call `deduplicate_entities` after graph construction; wire dormant `deduplicate_by_label`\n- `graphify/__main__.py` \u2014 add `--dedup-llm` flag parsing in extract block\n- `pyproject.toml` \u2014 add `datasketch`, `rapidfuzz` to base dependencies\n\n---"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_testing", "label": "Testing", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L119", "display_label": "Heading:Testing", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## Testing\n\n- Unit tests for each dedup step in isolation (`tests/test_dedup.py`)\n- Integration test: two chunks with overlapping entity labels \u2192 single merged node in output graph\n- Incremental test: run extract twice, assert second run makes zero LLM calls for unchanged files\n- Rename test: rename a file, assert cache hit and `source_file` updated correctly\n- Delete test: delete a file, assert its nodes are pruned from graph\n\n---"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_non_goals", "label": "Non-goals", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L129", "display_label": "Heading:Non-goals", "heading_level": 2, "text": "## Non-goals\n\n- `--dedup embed` (MiniLM cosine) \u2014 explicitly excluded, no PyTorch dependency\n- Incremental support for `graphify update` (AST-only) \u2014 already handled by existing AST cache\n- Dedup across different graph.json files (merge two graphs) \u2014 separate feature"}], "edges": [{"source": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_md", "target": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_design_incremental_updates_entity_deduplication", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_design_incremental_updates_entity_deduplication", "target": "$graphify-root$_docs_superpowers_specs_2026_05_04_incremental_updates_dedup_design_problem", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-04-incremental-updates-dedup-design.md", "source_location": "L9", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_docs